# day 26 · piece 3 of 4 — cron.txt: five fields and a command
#
# minute hour day-of-month month day-of-week — */15 is every quarter hour, 9-17 is a
# range of hours, 1-5 (or Mon-Fri) the weekdays. The skeleton runs every 15 minutes
# around the clock, every day.
#DAY 26
#FILE cron.txt
#RUN cat cron.txt
*/15 * * * * /home/learner/bin/backup.sh
#> out: */15 * * * *
#> out-not: 9-17
#> check: cron hour field: expected 9-17, got
#> check-not: PASS: day 26
